 :event/not-done-this-iteration "No prod-ready stub-scaffold attempted this iteration -- kept pace on the cheaper real-world-ingest-gap axis. The iteration-6 pre-screened candidate list is now exhausted except isic-1410 (apparel), isic-1430 (knitwear), isic-1512 (luggage) -- a future iteration should either land these or run a fresh :spec-basis classification pass over any newly-surfaced isic repos (or extend the classification method to other families: isco/assoc/municipality/cofog/unspsc have not yet been systematically classified this way). Axis alternation is now 4 prod-ready / 5 real-world-ingest-gap across 9 iterations.", :event/superproject-adr "adr-2607211900-cloud-itonami-actor-substrate-maturity-loop-charter", :event/seq 9, :event/at "2026-07-21T11:05:00Z"}
